.TH ZEILE 1 "27 October 2026" "zeile" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
zeile \- small GTK4 markdown viewer with live reload
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B zeile
[\fIOPTION\fR]... [\fIFILE\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B zeile
renders a markdown file in a GTK4 window, watches it for changes and
re-renders on save. A markdown file is treated as untrusted input:
document JavaScript is disabled, converted HTML is sanitized, a strict
Content-Security-Policy is applied, and the WebView has no network access
and no persistent storage.
.PP
Omit
.I FILE
to pick one in a file dialog. Clicking a link to another local
.B .md
file navigates in the same window with back/forward history.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.I FILE
Markdown file to display. If omitted, a file chooser dialog is shown.
.TP
.B \-\-enable\-mermaid
Render fenced
.B mermaid
blocks via
.B mmdc
(mermaid-cli). Off by default so the base install needs no Node.js.
.TP
.B \-\-debug
Enable WebKit developer tools. Same as setting the
.B ZEILE_DEBUG
environment variable.
.TP
.BI \-\-theme " THEME"
Start with a theme (also saved).
.I THEME
is one of:
.BR auto ,
.BR github\-light ,
.BR github\-dark ,
.BR catppuccin\-latte ,
.BR catppuccin\-frappe ,
.BR catppuccin\-macchiato ,
.BR catppuccin\-mocha ,
.BR solarized\-light ,
.BR solarized\-dark ,
.BR gruvbox\-light ,
.BR gruvbox\-dark ,
.BR nord ,
.BR dracula ,
.BR rose\-pine ,
.BR rose\-pine\-dawn ,
.BR tokyo\-night ,
.BR tokyo\-night\-day ,
.BR cyberpunk .
.TP
.BI \-\-body\-font " FONT"
Body font for this run (also saved).
.I FONT
is one of:
.BR system ,
.BR inter ,
.BR atkinson ,
.BR ia\-writer ,
.BR noto\-serif ,
.BR ibmplex\-sans .
.TP
.BI \-\-code\-font " FONT"
Monospace/code font for this run (also saved).
.I FONT
is one of:
.BR system ,
.BR jetbrains\-mono ,
.BR ia\-writer ,
.BR fira\-code ,
.BR cascadia\-code .
.TP
.BR \-h ", " \-\-help
Show a short help message and exit.
.SH KEYBOARD SHORTCUTS
.TP
.B Ctrl+R
Reload.
.TP
.B Ctrl+W / Ctrl+Q
Close.
.TP
.B Ctrl++ / Ctrl+\-
Zoom in / out.
.TP
.B Ctrl+0
Reset zoom.
.TP
.B Ctrl+F
Find in page.
.TP
.B Alt+Left / Alt+Right
Back / forward through visited local links.
.TP
.B Ctrl+T
Table of contents overlay (filter outline, stats, jump).
.TP
.B Ctrl+P
Print.
.TP
.B F11
Toggle fullscreen mode.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/zeile/settings.json
Persisted theme, fonts, zoom, window size and whether the start intro has
played. No document content is stored.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B ZEILE_DEBUG
If set to a non-empty value, enables WebKit developer tools (same as
.BR \-\-debug ).
.TP
.BR LANGUAGE ", " LANG
Select the UI language (English or German). Follows the usual gettext
locale rules.
.SH SECURITY
Markdown is untrusted. Document JavaScript is structurally disabled,
converted HTML is sanitized with an explicit allowlist, a
.B Content\-Security\-Policy
of
.B default\-src 'none'
is set, the WebView uses an ephemeral network session with no persistent
storage, and navigation outside the open document's directory is handed to
the system opener. Developer tools stay off unless
.B \-\-debug
or
.B ZEILE_DEBUG
is used. Optional
.B \-\-enable\-mermaid
runs an external
.B mmdc
helper that is not network-isolated by zeile.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR mmdc (1)
(optional, for
.BR \-\-enable\-mermaid ).
